== Notes ==

* This spell will not affect friendly targets (after accounting for the [[PvP setting]]).
* The penalty to attack rolls is not applied (''probably a bug'').<!-- The effect is created but not linked with the others. -->
* The penalty to damage rolls only reduces [[magical damage]].  If the affected creature does not deal magical damage in its attacks, there will be no change to the damage dealt.
* Spell resistance and a saving throw also apply to those entering the noxious cloud, but that saving throw lacks the "negative" subtype.
* The duration of the penalties is also d6 + 2 rounds, rolled independently of the duration of the cloud.
* Due to a .2da bug, ''cure light wounds'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.

